{{!
    @template local_a11y/face_hints

    Face Navigation HUD's "active" state usage hints: click and scroll.

    @description Markup for Face Navigation HUD's usage hints.
    @package    Moodle
    @subpackage Plugin a11y
    @author     Rodrigo Padilha Silveira <padilhars@gmail.com>
    @author     Jerônimo Medina Madruga <jeronimo.madruga@gmail.com>
    @copyright  Universidade Federal de Pelotas - UFPel
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later
    @version    0.1.0
    @since      0.1.0

    Context variables required for this template:
    * clicktext - the already-translated click-to-select hint (face_click lang string)
    * scrolltext - the already-translated scroll hint (face_scroll lang string)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "clicktext": "Dwell to click",
        "scrolltext": "Look up/down at the screen edge to scroll"
    }
}}
<div style="margin-bottom:4px">🖱️ {{clicktext}}</div>
<div>↕️ {{scrolltext}}</div>
